  "description": "<p>Simple mod that changes the size of all Food and Drink items to 1x1.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You can set certain items to be ignored — just add their IDs to the exclude.json file in the /config folder.</p>\n<p>Example of an excluded item listed in exclude.json:\n<em>Canister with purified water (5d1b33a686f7742523398398)</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p>This mod also affects item sizes from other Food and Drink mods, like <strong>WTT - Corner Store.</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p>❗<strong>NOTE: EFT caches your item icons. If something looks off, press the “Clean Temp Files” button in your SPT launcher to fix it.</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p>📁<strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Drag folder from zip file directly into your SPT install folder</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Install Mod\" /></p>\n",
